data: {"answer": "這裡是「教堂近看・個資原則」房間，彩繪玻璃上寫著六個個資原則：**目的**、**最小化**、**正確**、**保存期限**、**安全**、**問責**。\n看得到的防護措施為**資料最小化**與**保存期限**。\n你可以繼續前往導覽中的「隱私小教堂」（即本房間）。", "go": [], "followups": [{"text": "接下來要去哪？", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "zh", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.01, "answer_s": 21.33, "total_s": 21.35}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "church_near", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "church_near"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 7.3}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "church_near", "label": "Room", "en": "Chapel · Up Close", "zh": "教堂近看"}, {"key": "retention_deletion", "label": "Control", "en": "Data Minimization & Retention Schedule", "zh": "資料最小化與保存期限"}, {"key": "c_privacy_principles", "label": "Concept", "en": "Privacy Principles", "zh": "個資保護原則"}], "edges": [{"a": "c_privacy_principles", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "church_near"}, {"a": "c_privacy_principles", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "retention_deletion"}, {"a": "retention_deletion", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "church_near"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "房間：教堂近看・個資原則\n代表的資訊主題：近看每一片彩繪玻璃各寫著一個個資原則。\n重點：目的、最小化、正確、保存期限、安全、問責。\n看得到的防護措施：資料最小化與保存期限\n課程概念：個資保護原則\n可以走到：隱私小教堂（導覽裡的名稱：湖畔教堂）", "converted_to_traditional": true, "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 21.33, "load_s": 0.01, "prompt_tokens": 535, "prompt_s": 2.77, "gen_tokens": 82, "gen_s": 6.73, "tok_per_s": 12.2, "first_token_s": 14.6}}, "state": {}}

